### Brand Flow AI 后端主流程接口测试
### 使用方式：
### 1. 先执行“登录”，复制 access_token 到 @accessToken。
### 2. 执行“获取当前工作区可访问空间”，复制一个 spaceId 到 @spaceId。
### 3. 按顺序创建知识库、素材、工作流、作品，并把返回 ID 填到变量。

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = paste-login-or-switch-token-here
@workspaceId = paste-active-workspace-id-here
@spaceId = paste-space-id-from-get-org-spaces-here
@knowledgeId = paste-knowledge-id-here
@assetId = paste-asset-id-here
@workflowId = paste-workflow-id-here
@workId = paste-work-id-here

### 注册测试用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickname": "测试用户"
}

### 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 获取当前用户上下文
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 获取我的工作区
GET {{baseUrl}}/org/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 获取当前工作区可访问空间
GET {{baseUrl}}/org/spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 创建知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "name": "主流程测试知识库 {{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "REST Client 主流程测试"
}

### 创建知识项
POST {{baseUrl}}/knowledge/{{knowledgeId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "品牌色规范",
  "content": "品牌主色为 #00A862，海报中必须保持 Logo 清晰可见。",
  "tags": ["品牌色", "Logo"],
  "metadata": {
    "source": "api-flow"
  }
}

### 创建素材
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "name": "主流程测试素材 {{$timestamp}}",
  "type": "reference",
  "url": "https://cdn.example.com/assets/reference.png",
  "metadata": {
    "tags": ["reference"],
    "description": "主流程测试素材"
  }
}

### 将素材沉淀到知识库
POST {{baseUrl}}/assets/{{assetId}}/save-to-knowledge
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "knowledgeId": "{{knowledgeId}}",
  "description": "主流程测试素材知识沉淀"
}

### 创建工作流
POST {{baseUrl}}/workflow/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "prompt": "做一张夏日新品海报，突出品牌主色和清晰 Logo",
  "spaceId": "{{spaceId}}",
  "knowledgeIds": ["{{knowledgeId}}"]
}

### 获取工作流详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/workflow/{{workflowId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 保存作品
POST {{baseUrl}}/works
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "主流程测试作品 {{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "从工作流保存的作品",
  "finalImageUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/works/final.png",
  "objectKey": "works/api-flow/final.png",
  "workflowId": "{{workflowId}}",
  "qualityReport": {
    "totalScore": 90,
    "issues": []
  },
  "nodesSnapshot": {},
  "metadata": {
    "source": "api-flow"
  }
}

### 获取作品详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/works/{{workId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 获取作品列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/works
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
